<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan 3-month NCDs average yield at 5.195 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan 3-month NCDs average yield at 5.195 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank on Monday issued T$8 billion in three-month negotiable certificates of deposit at an average yield of 5.195 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The range of yields was between 5.180 and 5.210 percent, the official said. Demand totalled T$19 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
